Your feedback helps us improve search results.  Are you finding what you’re looking for? No Are you finding what you’re looking for? Yes 1 2 3 …  Next PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group logo PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group Share Show more options Machine Learning Engineer Tokyo, Japan · 3 weeks ago · 79 applicants Promoted by hirer · Actively reviewing applicants    On-site Matches your job preferences, workplace type is On-site.   Full-time Matches your job preferences, job type is Full-time.  Easy Apply  Save Save Machine Learning Engineer at PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group Machine Learning Engineer PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group · Tokyo, Japan (On-site)  Easy Apply  Save Save Machine Learning Engineer at PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group Show more options Unable to load your job match data Refresh People you can reach out to Aldrin profile photo Aldrin profile photo Aldrin Caragan  · 1st Recruitment Specialist at Active Connector Inc. | We are hiring in Japan | Passionate about connecting the right people to job opportunities that match their abilities and skill sets  Message About the job Job Title: Machine Learning Engineer Location: Tokyo Employment Type: Full-time (Regular Employment) Salary: up to 12M JPY/year Open for applicants who is currently residing in Japan with valid working visa for non-Japanese citizen    About the Company:  A leading Japanese firm provides AI-powered accounting automation solutions that eliminate repetitive manual tasks such as invoice processing, receipt handling, and digital invoice integration. Their software boosts accounting efficiency and compliance with evolving regulations, freeing professionals to focus on strategic tasks. This company holds the top market share in Japan’s AI OCR accounting solutions sector and works with major corporate clients to streamline financial workflows. It is publicly listed and recognized for advancing intelligent automation in enterprise accounting..       As a Machine Learning Engineer, you’ll help build the AI engineer at the core of our in-house AI services focused on the accounting field. You’ll work on a range of products that drive digital transformation and automation in accounting. Our Main AI Projects  AI-powered web application supporting digital transformation in accounting operations AI engine API service that automates accounting processes Peppol platform service for sending and receiving electronic invoices between systems   Your Role  You’ll be part of the Platform Department, working across all projects to develop shared AI-based components.  You’ll collaborate closely with research scientists (CV, NLP) and engineers using Scrum-based development.   Key Responsibilities  Develop and implement AI programs and models Work on image recognition, NLP, and document analysis Research and apply LLM and deep learning techniques Conduct data analysis, prototyping, and API development Collaborate with R&D teams to improve system quality and efficiency Contribute to internal study sessions and share technical insights   Why This Role Is Unique  Be part of cutting-edge AI development in accounting DX and AI x OCR Collaborate with top research scientists and engineers to build proprietary AI models and LLMs Work on real-world products used by businesses, leveraging rich, real industry data     Ideal Candidate:  Shares and aligns with the company’s mission and vision Demonstrates the company’s core values in daily work Values teamwork and collaborates effectively with others Strong logical thinking and problem-solving skills Highly motivated toward personal and professional growth   Requirements:  Must-Have:  Experience implementing models using Python in business application development Research experience related to CV or NLP Bachelor's degree (CS field) or higher Ability to research the latest papers and conduct implementation experiments   Nice-to-Have:  Experience in machine learning research, writing papers, and presenting at academic conferences  Experience in research or development using LLM Proven participation in Kaggle and top prize winners welcome Proven contribution to Open Source Software (OSS) Experience in product development using agile development     Perks & Benefits:  Flextime with no mandatory core hours Full transportation cost coverage (if visiting office occasionally) Health insurance Weekends and national holidays off End of year and New Year holidays Trial period: 6 months (standard)   We have more positions available—if you're open to new opportunities, don’t hesitate to apply!    Job ID: 05209  Benefits found in job post  Medical insurance About the company PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group company logo PeopleX Inc. Active Connector Group 38,700 followers  Following Staffing and Recruiting  11-50 employees  48 on LinkedIn Our team is dedicated to connecting global talent to innovative Japanese companies. That said, our work goes beyond connecting potential employees and employers. Our vision is to create a movement towards a more inclusive and diverse society. Our mission to help build connections that enable individuals to fully express their unique personality and maximize their skills across cultures and borders.  Despite being one of the world’s economic powerhouses, Japan continues to lag behind global competitors in innovation. We believe this is the result of not just the demographic crisis and consequent labor shortage, but also in the lack of diversity in Japan’s workforce. Promoting greater diversity and inclusivity against traditional standards of conformity in Japan is at the core of the work we do.  Companies around the world are recognizing the importance of celebrating and fostering talented, unique individuals as catalysts for growth and innovation in their organization. Those that have yet to embrace this in Japan are quickly realizing the need for change is not only necessary but well overdue.  Our company is here to build a movement to foster what makes every company, and country, innovative - people. We work with companies eager for not just diversity but for people who can be catalysts for change and innovation that take their business to new heights. … show more  Show more Md MaatarStatus is online MessagingYou are on the messaging overlay. Press enter to open the list of conversations.  Compose message You are on the messaging overlay. Press enter to open the list of conversations. Apapp picture Apapp  "
